    <item>
      <title>The $1.5 Trillion Hangover: AI’s Spectacular 2025 Reality Check</title>
      <description>We review the biggest year in AI spending, the explosion of autonomous systems, and the unprecedented legal backlash. From SoftBank's desperate $22.5 billion commitment to the rise of AI Psychosis and failing automation, Alex, Jamie, and Rufus dissect where the hype met reality—and whether the cash buffet is finally closed as we stare down zero measurable returns.</description>
